  "label": "Gender identity as a protected characteristic",
  "description": "Transgender identity refers to a person's internal sense of their own gender, which may differ from the sex they were assigned at birth. It is a protected characteristic under anti-discrimination laws in many jurisdictions. The meme targets this identity with hate speech, making understanding of transgender identity essential to comprehend the offense.",
